{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunters are always seeking to prove their worth by challenging the Beast Lords who live outside the Kingdom's borders. Assume control of one of these powerful warriors and take on increasingly challenging enemies with dangerous abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868820/extras/5d16c6252a82b83cdc46a70db03e0f3b.poster.avif?t=1752897097\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868820/extras/5d16c6252a82b83cdc46a70db03e0f3b.webm?t=1752897097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868820/extras/5d16c6252a82b83cdc46a70db03e0f3b.mp4?t=1752897097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2048-Style Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is straightforward.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher you take your 2048 score, the stronger your attacks will be</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you cannot move your board anymore, your attack resets, but you can decide to end it earlier.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skills you'll learn can manipulate the board in your favor, boost your attack, raise your defenses, debuff your enemy and other shenanigans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will try to sabotage your board in many different ways, while also attacking and healing themselves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an enemy is defeated, your stats will be raised and you will learn one extra skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fixed Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters are not random. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The options you get for your next fight are based on the last enemy you have defeated.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This allows you to plan ahead as you get to know the possible routes available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can prepare yourself to counter an enemy you know you can still find during the current run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 Characters with different abilities and stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 powerful skills to earn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 Enemies at the start of Early Access</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extremely satisfying and addictive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick gameplay sessions</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868820?t=1752897097","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868820/1b098b8cb141d7022d1723b6cbc76d8f5302bcb6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752897097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868820/d1e21fc17472914d9344742ef1702c7f707f6b75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752897097","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868820/d1e21fc17472914d9344742ef1702c7f707f6b75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752897097","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunters are always seeking to prove their worth by challenging the Beast Lords who live outside the Kingdom's borders. Assume control of one of these powerful warriors and take on increasingly challenging enemies with dangerous abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p