 you know you can still find during the current run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 Characters with different abilities and stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 powerful skills to earn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 Enemies at the start of Early Access</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extremely satisfying and addictive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick gameplay sessions</p></li></ul>","developers":["Suraimu Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868820/84fed8c5a65be4b968fe2f74170920087fd6567a/header.jpg?t=1752897097","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3868820/109252689/7d31da01fa80701bb761e916b396dd3ab108e664/1752113412/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752897095","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3868820/109252689/7d31da01fa80701bb761e916b396dd3ab108e664/1752113412/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752897095","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3868820/109252689/7d31da01fa80701bb761e916b396dd3ab108e664/1752113412/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752897095","id":257167130,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167130/movie480.mp4?t=1752897095","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167130/movie_max.mp4?t=1752897095"},"name":"2048 Bosses Beta Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257167130/b9fec8e03d5b09a5ed2abaa247a948eb685411ad/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752897095","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167130/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752897095","max":"https